# THROUGH-LABEL: name: through
# Every candidate is refused: $r1 cond overlap; $r2-$r7/$r12 computed-live
# through the edge (bb.2 reads them; NO stored livein names them — the
# retired stored-livein probe called them all free); R8-R11 unmentioned
# CSRs refused by the CSI-independent pristine law. Pre-stamp refusal:
# no mutation.
# THROUGH-NOT: LUI
# THROUGH: BEQZ_W $r1, %bb.2
# THROUGH: B %bb.1
...
