# PRISTINE-LABEL: name: pristine
# CSI valid + empty: R8-R11 are pristine — the computed walk itself seeds
# them live-out of the return block and refuses them (the retired
# AllowUnusedCSR second pass picked exactly here). No mutation.
# PRISTINE-NOT: LUI
# PRISTINE: BEQZ_W $r1, %bb.2
# PRISTINE: B %bb.1
...
