# RETAIN-LABEL: name: retain
# Arm B (unanalyzable two-cond tail, far trailing B to %bb.2 after 2040B of
# pad). $r4/$r5 are the RETAINED conds' registers (operand-coverage law);
# $r1/$r2/$r3/$r6/$r7/$r12 are computed-live through the edge; R8-R11 are
# unmentioned. Exhaustion refuses BEFORE removeBranch: all three
# terminators survive byte-identically.
# RETAIN-NOT: LUI
# RETAIN: BEQZ_W $r4, %bb.2
# RETAIN: BEQZ_W $r5, %bb.1
# RETAIN: B %bb.2
...
